hi i'm ria and today i'm going to show  you how to make three amazing recipes  using homemade bread dough  so this bread dough recipe i got it from  the restaurant i used to work for  our pastry chef jun who is my mentor he  told me this recipe it's very versatile  recipe so i made a three different way  of you can make something at home i used  to make this every day because we make  it fresh every day when you are using  yeast east likes room temperature water  and a day like sugar don't use hot water  because that kills yeast and cold water  doesn't activate the yeast so make sure  to use lukewarm water and you have to  knead it very well about eight to ten  minutes until dough becomes very bouncy  so this is kind of how i'm porking the  dough and it bounced back also you have  to reset and rise the dough about one  hour to two hours in a warmer place  [Music]  another trick when you are shaping  dinner roll is to close the seam so it  kind of holds nice cute round shape  [Music]  if you wanted to make it the day in  advance you can make the dough and put  it in the refrigerator and rest it for  overnight  [Music]  one of the bread recipe is sticky bun  the sticky bun was really good it was  very delicious  sticky pan is a bread with sweet caramel  on the bottom it's like gooey caramel  bread it's so good sticky pans is great  for breakfast and i love sweet breakfast  like french toast and pancakes and  waffles it's my favorite i feel like if  you eat sweet things in the morning you  feel less guilty so  i feel like you can eat as much as you  want  maybe  maybe not it's very different than  breakfast  in japan it's the same process as for  the dinner roll you just put brown sugar  and butter mixture on the bottom of the  skillet and bake it in the oven  [Music]  [Music]  so for focaccia  you use the same dough just instead of  cutting it into individual portions you  use whole dough and spread it then poke  holes with your fingers  it helps to soak the olive oil more  it's just like a nice feeling if you  kind of sink your fingers in the dog  so embrace that moment when you're  making it  i used rosemary olive oil salt and black  pepper i was called out by italian  audience saying that this is not  focaccia  but this is how we made it in a  restaurant in america so maybe it's  american focaccia  but it's definitely tasty  [Music]  making bread is very inexpensive and  easily impress your friends sometimes  making bread sounds a little bit  intimidating but this recipe is very  simple and easy so if your first time  baking bread give this a try  [Music]  yes yes okay okay  you
 

